window.products.push({"id":327013,"name":"Wall Hooks, ASSIS Stainless Steel Decorative Wall Mounted Key Holder Letter Hook Adhesive Hooks Key Hooks Rack Letter \"P\" (2.3 X 2.7 inches）, Coat Hoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NqYY-2fKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Not every hood is made to catch the eye of the viewer but these Stainless Steel Wall Hook definitely are. Made and designed to stand out and look absolutely stunning no matter where or how you are using these gorgeous letter key hooks. Imagine walking home to a Stainless Steel Wall Mounted Key Holder that is spelled out as your name! With the versatility and flexibility of use these provide, you cannot just spell your own name but anything you want – you can le t your creativity flow and decide what word would suit your space best! Made with type 304 premium grade stainless steel as well as Nickel, to make the most durable, rust and corrosion resistant Decorative Wall Hook that will enhance the way your walls look without having to worry about replacing them ever year. From hanging hats to carrying them around in your pocket these stainless steel key holders will let people know your keen fashion sense and help you standout. At ASSIS your comfort and satisfaction are our top priority. The hooks of this Decorative Wall Hook is sanded and smooth to provide the best traction for hanged clothes without causing them any kind of harm. The best part is that unlike other hooks and hanger you don’t need to drill a hole in your wall. These attach to walls using the powerful 3M self-adhesive applied on the backs to stay in one place dependably without having to damage your walls!  Mounting instructions: 1.Clean the contact area on the wall and ensure that it is dry and free from dust or oil 2.Remove the protective film the back of the plate and do not touch the adhesive surface 3.Place the product in the right location and press firmly all around to secure the product 4.Suggest not to use the product in 24 hours after installation to ensure that the product is firmly fixed and secured","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NqYY-2fKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASSIS","source_asin":"B01IT8S4OS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IT8S4OS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IT8S4OS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
