window.products.push({"id":327052,"name":"Beeswax Food Wrap | Sustainable Eco-Friendly Beeswax wrap | Plastic Free Reusable Bees wrap | Organic Natural Bees wax","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hP7UDhBAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MONEY SAVING & ECO-FRIENDLY Say goodbye to single-use plastics that are harming our planet & say hello to our reusable beeswax food wrap! Perfect for the budget aware & eco-conscious, these bee wax wraps are reusable. Our wax wraps for food reusable are a great option to save you money & reduce your contribution to the landfills! NATURAL SOLUTION TO FOOD STORAGE Made from earth friendly materials, our beeswax wraps are a natural solution for storing & packing your food. The reusable food wrap is made using beeswax, jojoba oil, & tree resin over a paper food wrap. You can use the bee wax wraps to carry your lunch or use the reusable food wrap to cover a bowl of leftovers. SIMPLE TO USE To use the reusable beeswax food wrap, simply allow the warmth of your hands to make the beeswax wrap pliable. Then wrap our wax wraps for food reusable around your food or cover your dish of leftovers. As the beeswax food wrap cools, it will quickly form a seal that is nice & tight! EASY TO CARE FOR After each use, you can easily wash your bee wax wraps using a mild soap & cool water. Allow the food wrap to air dry, & it is ready to go again. WHAT YOU GET You will receive a 3 pack of reusable beeswax food wraps in a variety of sizes. Large – 14x13” Large – 14x13” Medium – 10x11” Medium – 10x11” Small – 8x7” Small – 8x7” You can also choose from different colors for your beeswax wraps. We offer pink, gray, red, & multi-color including red, green & yellow. ✔ You could do your part in ending the use of plastics! Buy your reusable beeswax food wrap pack today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hP7UDhBAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MGchef","source_asin":"B07X2LNLZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X2LNLZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X2LNLZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327053,"name":"NWA Custom Engraved Large American Flag and Eagle Wooden Funeral Cremation Urn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RFgwNu4mL._AC_.jpg","description":"PROUDLY HONOR YOUR LOVED ONES: American Flag and Eagle Cremation Urn. This adult size urn features a 3-D Eagle and flag resin and a personalized engraved plate to commemorate a loved one. It is an eye-catching work of art for your home that is perfect for nature-lovers while also serving as a lovely resting place for your loved one. HANDCRAFTED WITH UTMOST CARE AND QUALITY: Our dedicated team of skilled artists create our URNS FOR ASHES with superior craftsmanship and the highest-quality materials. Each urn is constructed of high quality rose wood and meticulously hand-finished with details to respectfully commemorate your loved one. This CREMATION URN is approximately 7.25\"x 11\" x 5.5\"and can hold up to 260 pounds of body weight before cremation. DURABLE: Our CREMATION URNS FOR HUMAN ADULT ASHES are designed to stand the test of time with their BEST IN CLASS and DURABLE construction. Each Urn is Bottom Loading with a secure bottom opening. The bottom panel is secured by screws. Please use a Philip head screw- driver to undo the screws. COMMEMORATE YOUR LOVED ONE WITH A CUSTOM ENGRAVED TRIBUTE: As shown in the picture, the urn can be personalized to honor your loved one for no extra charge. Please click the \"CUSTOMIZE NOW” button to personalize the item. *We encourage you to thoroughly REVIEW the text for engraving carefully before adding the item to cart. We engrave the exact information we receive with the order and do not make any changes at our end. Please review the text to make sure all spellings and information are correct.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RFgwNu4mL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NWA","source_asin":"B00MSC29UW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MSC29UW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MSC29UW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
