window.products.push({"id":327102,"name":"Tovolo Spatulart Fireworks Spatula","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zoLPuk2SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some extra flavor to your kitchen with our collection of vibrant printed spatulas. The high performance silicone heads and fade-proof, stain-resistant silicone ink makes this Spatula a functional work of art! This is a must have, great for cooking on the stove top as well as scraping the batter out of the bowl. This spatula has a quality ergonomically shaped handle that delivers the perfect weight and balance in your hand while providing an easy grip. Edges are tapered to a sharp point to scrape the side of the bowl completely clean. The square corner will fit into the tightest spots of any pan and the completely smooth surface allows for even spreading. From head to handle's end the spatula measures 12.5\"L x 2.4\"W x .4\"H. At Tovolo, we believe time spent cooking should be fun and we are honored to be a part of that experience in each home that uses our products. We challenge ourselves to improve the performance, function, and appearance of kitchen tools. Something as simple as a silicone spatula moves us to create the perfect experience for our customers. We obsess over every detail to ensure that our spatula will outperform expectations. However, performance alone is not enough; we want to put a smile on the customer’s face as well. Whether it is our Spatulart silicone spatulas, our assortment of frozen pop molds or our whimsically shaped ice molds, we strive to add a colorful element of fun to each of our items, to do just that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zoLPuk2SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B00ZIJHTMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZIJHTMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZIJHTMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
