window.products.push({"id":327160,"name":"Naomi Home Bathroom Mirror with Lights LED Vanity Mirror Wall Mounted, Anti Fog,Touch Switch Silver/35 x 27\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-80TfOBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VANITY MIRROR WITH LIGHTS - Two touch buttons: 1 the LED Bathroom mirror responds quickly by simply touching the switch on/off. Energy saving white LED lighting:54W (Diffuse 30W, LED Strip 24W) - Color Temperature: 2 colors of brightness, you can customize 5500K daylight or 6000K cool white as you like it. Input: AC100-120V,50/60Hz. UNIQUE DESIGN : This wall mounted vanity mirror is designed with user in mind, for both form and function. The modern sleek design with touch controls add a touch of exclusivity and futuristic look to your room. The backlit LED lights provides ample illumination without hurting your eyes making this perfect wall mounted vanity mirror for personal grooming. This bathroom mirror can also be installed verticlaly or horizonatlly. 40 mm aluminum frame on the back ensure durability. ANTI-FOG : The anti-fog function ensures that you get a pristine reflections even after a steam shower, making this the perfect bathroom mirror. Just touch the Anti-fog switch to turn on/off anti-fog. The surface of the bathroom mirror and the frame are moisture-proof to prevent water vapor from penetrating the interior of the mirror, which ensures that the internal electrical components will not damage. EASY ASSEMBLY-All the necessary elements for installing the wall mounted vanity mirror are included together with the instructions. SAFE SHIPPING-Naomi Home LED Vanity mirror with lights is packed in a hard-cardboard packaging and also protected by plastic film, which effectively eliminates the risk of damaging the product during transport. We pay close attention to the delivery on time, that's why we work with the best courier companies and we supervise the delivery process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-80TfOBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naomi Home","source_asin":"B07L9H2QDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L9H2QDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L9H2QDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
