window.products.push({"id":327186,"name":"BEDELITE Twin Comforter Set - Blue Comforter Twin Soft Bedding Lightweight Comforter Set, Cationic Dyeing Striola Pattern Reversible Practical (1 Comf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WFv84SFXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Surprise Design: We start to use new cationic dyeing method to make the appearance more unique and novel than usual normal dyeing. We have designed double side available, one side is cationic dyed while another side is plain dyed, it will give the comforters soul not stiff, you can use any side depends on your mood. Cationic dyeing not easy fade, subtle patterns are not rigid but fashionable, irregular pinstripes are vibrant and layered. It is a nice gift for friends and relatives. Luxurious Soft&Comfy: Why it can have so soft and comfy hand feeling? Why it can keep warm and cozy? Why it won’t be wet even if sweaty person use it? Due to we have add a washed process to make the fabric soft and comfortable. Then we use luxurious shaggy filling to ensure it can keep warm and cosy. And we use breathable fabric to guarantee it's drying even you're a sweaty person. You will love it’s cotton soft, comfortable and smoothly once you touch it, especially when you sleep naked. Premium Sleep: Our comforter set is lightweight and fluffy, it will not put downward pressure on your body. Once you sleep in it, you may feel like you are sleep in soft cotton. Due to lightweight, will help you easy to fall asleep without pressure. Special breathable fabric will keep dry all night, you can sleep comfortable without the unpleasant feeling of being wet. Fluffy filling will keep warm in cold night even you use long time, ensure you have a sweetly sleep. Multi-Size: There will be Three sizes to meet many users needs. Twin size comforters for twin bed (1 comforter 68*88 inch, 1pillow shams 20*26 inch), Queen size comforters for queen bed (1 comforter 88*88 in, 2pillow shams 20*26 in), King size comforters for king bed (1 comforter 102*90 in, 2pillow shams 20*36 in). Easy Care& Maintain: Machine washable cold separately, gentle cycle only, dry on low heat, do not iron, do not dry clean. We adopt stitching design on the comforter, it can ensure the filling fixed and uniform in the place to maintain the comforter and not agglomeration for long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WFv84SFXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDELITE","source_asin":"B08R3FXRS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R3FXRS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R3FXRS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327187,"name":"Holster Brands Hot Flat Iron / Curling Iron / Hair Tools Holder, Organizer, Travel Pouch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kAjYgWZfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nullify Imported Cradle your hot tools in heat resistant silicone Conveniently attaches to any smooth, non-porous surface Easy to place, move and clean Silicone has been tested to withstand temperatures up to 500 degrees Perfect for hot irons, blow dryers, curling irons and more! Instructions: When applying the product, the smooth surface AND the silicone flap should be CLEAN and DRY to ensure maximum grip. If your Holster loses grip, clean with a wet, lint-free cloth or wipe clean with isopropyl and lint-free cloth. After cleaning, be sure the backside of the silicone flap is completely dry before placing on a clean, dry surface. Also be sure your sink or countertop is free of dust and build-up when you apply the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kAjYgWZfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holster Brands","source_asin":"B01AX9SGZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AX9SGZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AX9SGZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
