window.products.push({"id":327190,"name":"Natural Pure Beeswax Candles Organic Honey Eco Blue Color Candles in Gift Box (Natural Cotton Wicks, Dripless, Smokeless, Not Taper Candles) (Blue, 6 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-cHnJXD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Beeswax candles are absolutely natural product. We use 100 percent pure natural beeswax to make these candles. Beeswax candles are unlike other candles. They create beautiful ambiance with their warm glow, soft honey scent that does not release toxins.   Natural beeswax candles have long been known for their air purifying effects and can greatly reduce odors in your home. By burning 100 percent beeswax candles you can transform the unpleasant odors in any room without the use of chemicals. Studies have shown that burning beeswax stimulates the pituitary gland, increasing intuition, creativity and heightening dream activity. Some say burning a beeswax candle before bed helps them achieve a more restful sleep.  Pure beeswax is best for those with allergies or sensitivities to scents. Recent studies have shown paraffin candles, especially ones scented with synthetic fragrance oils, can increase indoor air pollution. Synthetic fragrance oils are commonly used to scent most candles and contain phthalates to stabilize and enhance the scent. Phthalates are a common hazardous chemical known to cause harmful abnormalities, birth defects and reproductive problems.  Use our pure beeswax candles for:  - romantic dinners  - after work chill-out  - birthday cakes  - engagements  - weddings  - holidays  - meditation  - religious purposes.   Our natural Beeswax candles become a great universal gift that will not leave anyone indifferent, and help to give zest to any holiday celebration or event. The remarkable quality of product helps to make any occasion special and unforgettable!   Before shipping the candles carefully hand packed in stretch film that prevents the penetration and the impact of any foreign odors. This type of packaging to minimize the damage of candles during transportation, delivery and storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-cHnJXD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GP Natural","source_asin":"B087D7H3P3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087D7H3P3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087D7H3P3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327191,"name":"Diagona Designs Contemporary Moroccan Trellis Border Design Non-Slip Runner Rug, 31\" W x 118” L, Charcoal/Ivory …","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817rp-T95iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This contemporary Moroccan trellis border design area rug features a power loomed nylon low profile pile which is durable for a long lasting quality. Inspired by traditional patterns with contemporary colors. Please Note: Rug colors may vary slightly due to differences in computer monitors. We do our best to provide you with an exact measurement, but please be advised that some variation exists. Patterns may vary slightly according to shape and size selected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817rp-T95iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Diagona Designs","source_asin":"B01G2IC0OM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G2IC0OM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G2IC0OM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
