window.products.push({"id":327303,"name":"Electric Air Pump for Inflatables, 2 in 1 Portable Quick-Fill Air Pump,110V AC & 12V DC Inflator Deflator for Air Mattress, Swimming Rings, Airbeds, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A1yYIIrbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💨【Super Power】--This pump is intended to inflate/deflate items,such as inflatable boat,air mattress,etc.Electric pump with a US plug,3 interconnecting nozzles,fit most inflatable items which with fast filling and high pressure design. So that can achieve faster,more efficient in daily use.Bring a perfect and relaxing trip for your family!!! 💨【Inflate & Deflate 2 in 1 Usage】-- the pump for inflatables can not only for inflating, but also for deflating.This is equipped with strong quality motor to ensure fast inflation and deflation.Inflatable pump will automatic inflate/ deflate items quickly. Help you save much more time than use manual pump. Just put full heart in enjoying fun time of yours! 💨【Lightweight & Portable】--The small size of our wireless air pump for air mattress is made with ABS plastic material. Moreover, the package comes with a mini storage bag, it’s very portable to take, especially save more places when camping, hiking or taking on holiday. The design of airbed pump electric is advanced with high-quality material, which greatly reduces its noise in operation!!! 💨【3 General Purpose Nozzles】-- Our airbed pump electric comes with S, M, L three Nozzles, which meets all of our demands to inflate or deflate different items. Such as, airbed, air mattress, pools, rafts, air sofas, bathtub, water beds, boat, pool toys and swimming rings. Note: Please choose the right nozzle which matches to different items before using.Car charging is really convenience. 💨【Easy to use】--Our blow up mattress pump is simple to operate. To inflate, simply place the inflation head on the filling port and press the switch. To deflate, place the inflation head in the vent hole, and then press the switch to deflate. The air mattress pump is compatible with 12V DC and 110V AC power supplies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A1yYIIrbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dafire","source_asin":"B08VHV6HR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VHV6HR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VHV6HR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
