window.products.push({"id":327306,"name":"Boho Shower Curtain for Bathroom-Perfect for Bohemian, Modern or Farmhouse Bathroom Decor-Made from Premium Polyester Fabric 72\" L x72 W-2 Sets of Fre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811bWvPQJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Q1. What is the size of the shower curtain? A1: 72\" L x 72\" H that will fit most standard bathtubs and shower stalls. Q2: What decor style will the shower curtain fit? A2: Our shower curtains are designed to work well with boho, farmhouse, modern or transitional style. Q3: What colors and patterns? A3: This collection features a variety of colors and patterns such as grey, cream, green, teal, blue, yellow, taupe, and pink.  Patterns range from geometric, leaves, flowers, stripes, chevron, herringbone, diamond and more. Q4: What material? A4: Our shower curtains are made from premium polyester with much tighter weave resulting in a smooth texture and soft hand feel. It drapes beautifully and will last longer. Q5: How many buttonholes? A5: Each shower curtain has 12 metal grommet buttonholes. These grommets are also rust-resistant. Q6: Does it come with hooks or rings? A6: Yes, it comes with 2 sets of hooks in white plastic or silver metal. Each set has 12 hooks. You only need one set at a time. Q7: Is it easy to install? A7: Absolutely. Choose from one set of hooks and hang the hooks on the curtain rod. Then loop the holes of the shower curtain over the hooks, making sure the front (finished) side of the curtain is facing out. To uninstall, unhook the shower curtain. Q8: Is it machine-washable? A8: Yes. Machine wash cold, separately. Gentle cycle. Tumble dry low. It's recommended to replace the old shower curtain with a new one every six months.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811bWvPQJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aspenhagen Designs","source_asin":"B093J8X8P5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093J8X8P5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093J8X8P5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
