window.products.push({"id":327312,"name":"Teemto China Storage Containers Quilted. 7PC Dishes Storage Kit with 48 Cut-to-Size Felt Inners. Fine China Storage, Plate Platter Storage, Glass and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QPcic7QuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Plate storage with more care: While some dish packing supplies may seem ideal – Teemto goes beyond the basic features to make your life easier. Because Teemto is the only storage and moving kit that features useful carrying handles, More dish storage containers, thick card divider protection and 48 handy Cut-To-Size Felt inners both large and small! ✅7 Piece set: Because no two plates are the same, The Teemto Dish Storage Protectors come in 7 different sizes! Listed here (Diameter x Height): Dinner Plates (12x7.5”) Dessert Plates (8.5x5.5”) Saucer Plates (7x5.25”) Salad Plate (10x6”) Platter Storage (18x12x1”) Tea cups (Rectangular 15.25x13x5”) Stemware (4x10”). So, go ahead and measure up your crockery now and see how perfect they’ll fit! ✅Quilted with Made-to-fit felt: Most plate storage containers only come with one size of felt separation. So you have to cut them to size and make a mess. We give you 48x 2mm thick Felt Inners – 12 Dinner Plates, 24 Saucers/Salad and 12 Dessert Plate sizes. Each case is made with a 5mm thick polyester quilting. And you’ll be pleased to know we selected the maximum thickness available for this set. ✅Handy handles! Teemto is the only set of dinnerware storage containers to come with a handle. That makes them easier to transport of course, but guess what? It means you could use your dish storage boxes for other things, like taking plates of food to potluck dinners or camping storage. You’ll also love the ID Tags on the outside of each plate storage box so you know exactly what’s inside. ✅Internal dividers: The wine glass storage and cup / mug storage pouches also have thick cardboard dividers with 3x3” space for cups and 2x2” space for stemware. Now, you may also want to add your own bubble wrap, and that’s ok - you now have all the information available to make those decisions. So why not try Teemto now risk free. Comes with replacement or money back if needed. Teemto, Storage That Cares.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QPcic7QuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teemto","source_asin":"B091D7VVDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091D7VVDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091D7VVDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327313,"name":"EBLSE Simple Round Side Coffee Table with Drawer, Fashion Elegant Sofa Tables Suitable for Bedroom, Living Room, Guest Room, Office, Bathroom or Any O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gfJxYpx1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Introductions: This good table is easy to compliment to your home decor and highlight taste. What is more, it will be a good decoration in your home, kitchen and office! Features: 【AMPLE STORAGE SPACE】Plenty of storage space with the pull-out drawer and spacious cabinet to keep small daily used items like remote controllers, keys, glasses neat and clean; tabletop also provides a sufficient place for lamp, clock and cups for your convenience 【MULTIFUNCTION】 Also used as an end table beside your sofa or a simple storage cabinet suitable for bathroom, hallway, living room and more, ensuring you an integration of practical storage and home decoration 【PRACTICAL CABINET】This basic bedside table with simple design and classical color can be compatible with different room styles and décor; you can place it in your bedroom, living room, guest room, office, bathroom or any other places you want 【SIMPLE-TO-ASSEMBLE】Detailed and illustrated user instructions as well as required fittings and tools are all attached for your worry-free assembly Specifications: 1. Color: Coffee 2. Material: MDF 3. Overall Dimensions: (18.5 x 18.5 x 27.95)\" / (47 x 47 x 71)cm (L x W x H) 4. Weight Capacity: 33lb / 15kg Package Includes: 1 x Table 1 x Accessories 1 x Manual Notes: 1. When receiving the goods, please confirm the product according to the listing of instructions. Once you find less pieces, please provide relevant pictures to contact us. We will deal it in the time. 2. Please install goods with the instruction manual. 3. It is recommended that the installation should not be too tight to adjust easily. After the structure is installed, firm the interface for more stability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gfJxYpx1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EBLSE","source_asin":"B088R7SDPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088R7SDPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088R7SDPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327314,"name":"Magnetic Poetry - Mixed Up Parent Kit - Words for Refrigerator - Write Poems and Letters on The Fridge - Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lsjaNOh7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We've all heard them and some of us have even used them--they're the time-tested phrases parents use when they try to make those darn kids behave! The Mixed-Up Parent Kit takes those phrases and puts them in a verbal blender so that a scolding parent never sounded so funny. Whether you're talking sense to a sullen teen or getting junior to eat his vegetables, you'll find a new way to say it in this kit. Contains over 180 magnetic word tiles. Tile height is .375\" and packaging size is 4.75w x 3h x 1.25\"d.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lsjaNOh7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnetic Poetry","source_asin":"B0045VB95A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0045VB95A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0045VB95A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
