window.products.push({"id":327329,"name":"Qualita Paper Baking Moulds - Dove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417vUZH0TeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Perfect for gift giving and holiday celebrations, this paper baking mould is designed to be part of the packaging, eliminating the need to remove cakes from their pans before giving or selling. The mould is of a rigid freestanding construction, so you simply fill with batter, bake, cool, and wrap; the base and wall are micro-perforated to eliminate excess humidity. This traditional style Colomba di Pasqua mould is in the shape of a dove, a symbol of peace. Includes fitted bags for wrapping the finished panettone for freshness or gift-giving.Microwave, freezer, and oven safe to 450°F/200C.Set of 20: 10 moulds and 10 bagsColour/Pattern: Dark brown with a gold floret print overlayDimensions: 9-7/8\"L × 7-1/8\"W × 2\"DMaterials: Pure cellulose calendered paper, micro-flute corrugated, with micro-perforationKosher (not repackaged under kashrut supervision)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417vUZH0TeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qualita","source_asin":"B0038OCFP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0038OCFP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0038OCFP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
