window.products.push({"id":327347,"name":"Pearhead My First Christmas Stocking, Baby’s First Christmas, Holiday Home Décor Accessory, Classic Stocking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hvJXmb7FL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare for your baby’s first Christmas with Pearhead’s “my 1st Christmas” stocking. We know there are very few things in life as special as a baby’s first big holiday so Pearhead created this adorable Christmas keepsake that features plush red velvet with white embroidered lettering that reads “my 1st Christmas.” A baby’s first Christmas is filled with joyous anticipation and excitement for Santa and his flying reindeer. The holiday season is a magical time of year and we know new parents want to make it memorable for their jolly little elf with a Christmas baby stocking by Pearhead. This baby’s first Christmas stocking allows you to cherish and remember your baby’s first Christmas with a traditional Christmas stocking design and quality fabric. The bright red stocking and the white accents blend beautifully with your existing holiday decorations. This Christmas keepsake also comes with a fabric loop so this charming piece of classic holiday décor can be hung by the chimney with care right away. It’ll be ready for all the presents that Santa has Gidden away in his pack. This holiday keepsake isn’t just for Christmas gift giving, it also makes an excellent birthday gift for baby or a creative shower gift for an expecting couple any time of the year. They’ll be ready for Santa as soon as December rolls around and the snow starts to fall. This special keepsake also makes a perfect addition to your own baby shower gift registry so you’ll have an adorable memento to remember that special first Christmas. Dimensions: 10”W x 15”H x 1.13”D","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hvJXmb7FL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pearhead","source_asin":"B0BXTVDBZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXTVDBZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXTVDBZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
