window.products.push({"id":327632,"name":"ADVPRO nc0379-b Royal Flush Casino Skull Poker Game Room Neon Sign LED Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aweeWV-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Overall diameter of the Clock is 10 inch/ 25cm with a frame made of aluminum The source of the light is LED light, which is bright & energy saving, lifespan is more than 100,000 hours (around 10 years if you keep turning it on) The CE clock runs on one AA battery (not included) and an AC power cord (110v to 240v) for the lights (included). We provide an **US plug to USA & CA **UK plug to UK **AU plug to Australia **EU plug to EU & other countries Default color is shown in the first gallery picture, if you need to change to other colors (either blue, red, green), please contact us after payment confirmed AdvPro Clocks are carved by the latest 3D, Surface and Line engraving technologies (attractive in all directions). We are not using the laser engraving method which only provides 2D surface effect","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aweeWV-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ADVPRO","source_asin":"B00AXFVRA4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXFVRA4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXFVRA4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327633,"name":"SHAMROCK PRETZEL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sw7YcrlML._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sw7YcrlML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJRB9U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJRB9U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJRB9U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
