window.products.push({"id":327663,"name":"ELINEN 100% Tencel Sheet Set - Queen Size 4 Piece Sheets with Deep Pockets up to 18 Inches - Luxuriously Cooling, Super Soft & Silky Sateen Weave Lyoc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lMLLfdL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Eucalyptus Lyocell TENCEL】 100% TENCEL Lyocell are crafted from eucalyptus trees that are sustainably grown on biodiverse farms. Our eco-friendly manufacturing process ensures minimal waste production, aligning with our commitment to sustainable practices. 【Queen Size Package Contents】Our Queen size 4-piece bed sheet set includes 1 flat sheet measuring 90\" x 102\", 1 fitted sheet measuring 60\" x 80\" + 16\" with deep pockets that fit mattresses up to 18\", and 2 standard size pillowcases measuring 20\" x 30\". 【Luxurious Feel】Crafted from TENCEL Lyocell, our sheets are incredibly soft and silky, gentle on the skin, and smooth to the touch. The fabric is thermal regulating, providing enhanced breathability, durability, and is biodegradable and compostable. ELINEN Tencel sheets offer excellent moisture-wicking properties and breathability, keeping you warm on winter nights and cool during the summer. With a timeless style, they effortlessly blend with any bedroom decor. These sheets are perfect for any room in your home, including the bedroom, guest room, kids' room, RV, or vacation home. 【OEKO-TEX Certified】Our products are certified by OEKO-TEX, ensuring that every inch of our fabric conforms to top performance standards and the best international quality processes. With a silky soft and comfortable touch, our sheets provide maximum satisfaction. The expertly tailored design adds elegance and sophistication to your bedroom, providing a luxurious sleeping experience. 【Easy Care】Our sheets and pillowcases are fade, stain, and shrink resistant, making them easy to clean. Simply machine wash in cold water with similar colors, and tumble dry on low. They can also be ironed on a warm setting if necessary, but should not be bleached. These beautiful sheets are skin-friendly, hypoallergenic, and designed to last long, ensuring a comfortable and hassle-free sleeping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lMLLfdL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELINEN","source_asin":"B08T8ZST1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T8ZST1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T8ZST1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
