window.products.push({"id":327873,"name":"PEIZI 20oz Tumbler with lid, Stainless Steel Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Travel Mug, Durable Powder Coated Coffee Cup, Stainless steel, 4 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LSJRC1YQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A WONDERFUL GIFT FOR EVERYONE: For those who love outdoor activities such as hiking and camping, the sturdy, portable and heat-retaining tumbler can definately meet your needs. For those who spend lots of time commuting to the office, it allow you take your time drinking your morning brew on the go. For those who enjoy BBQs, birthday parties and festival celebrations, it is a stylish and practical gift prepared for you and your family! PREMIUM INSULATED COFFEE TUMBLER: Double wall vacuum insulated prevent heat transfer to the outer walls of the tumbler, condensation free and long lasting. Great for all beverages, keeps hot drinks (like hot Coffee) up to 3 hours and cold (like Iced Water, Coffee or Coca) up to 9 hours. So you could enjoy your beverage cold or hot by the pool, take your cup of joe on the go. PREMIUM MATERIAL: The tumbler is made from high quality 18/8 304 food grade stainless steel. Lead free and durable. Rust-proof, easy wash, dishwasher safe and unbreakable. When washing, our tumbler is BPA Free so you are safe from toxins. SUPERIOR PEARLIZED COATED FINISH: Sweat proof, outside stays dry, easy grip. Electro-polished interior doesn't transfer flavor & no metal aftertaste, you don't have to worry about your morning coffee or afternoon teas being ruined. Designed for car cup holders. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: We provide 100% satisfaction after sale service, if there is anything wrong with your order, please enter our store and email us, we will make every effort to solve your problem. We are happy to provide 100% money back if you are not fully satisfied with the tumbler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LSJRC1YQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PEIZI","source_asin":"B08BS4FYGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BS4FYGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BS4FYGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327874,"name":"HAUS AND HUES Mid Century Modern Wall Art Sun Boho Posters and Prints Wall Art Mid Century Modern Print Sun Art Print Boho Pictures for Wall Boho Art ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CX8W8Pf1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CREATE A WARM WELCOME: Hang this highly expressive yellow sunray print in your entryway, dorm room, apartment, and see how your family and friends greet you with a big smiles because of the good vibes it creates! This bohemian wall art by Haus & Hues features an unconventional image of the sun with its colorful rays in bold earth tones: navy blue, mustard yellow, terracotta, and maroon. Your guests will surely go home happy because of the sunny bliss they get from your decor DESIGN YOUR OWN INVITING SPACE: This sun print fits so many styles because of its classic design and vibrant colors. With proper styling and accessories, this poster can be a mid-century wall art, boho decor wall art, minimal wall art, southwestern wall art, and even retro-hippie decor. Hang this wall art boho using putty, double-sided poster tape, or thumbtacks in your dorm room, nursery, coffee bar, bathroom, and kid's playroom to get that tranquil transformative atmosphere PREMIUM QUALITY: To achieve the quality we’re known for, we use a giclée printing technique on 270 GSM solar white linen paper. The paper we use for sun wall art is sourced in the US, and our inks are water-based and toxic-free. Our Pennsylvania oak frame adds the finishing touch to the mid century wall art. It’s equipped with plexiglass covered by protective film and two metal hangers for horizontal or vertical hanging. Sun poster is shipped in a durable box for protection while in transit SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our in-house team ensures every boho art prints order passes our quality inspection to minimize misprints and order defects. We want you to shop our boho wall prints with confidence, so we offer a hassle-free return and refund guarantee. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, let us know and we'll provide you with a full refund or replacement A THOUGHTFUL GIFT: Our midcentury wall decor will make a great gift for friends and family. Give your loved ones this boho art wall decor for a birthday, housewarming, graduation, Christmas, or any special occasion. This boho wall decore is a perfect way to add color and a personal touch to any space","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CX8W8Pf1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B08V7GC6LW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V7GC6LW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V7GC6LW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":327875,"name":"ANDY STAR Brushed Nickel Round Mirror, 30\" Large Silver Round Bathroom Mirror for Wall in Stainless Steel Metal Frame for Bathroom, Vanity, Entryway, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zl+6opH+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"90% 4mm Silver Glass+ 10% 1 Inch Metal Frame+ 9mm Mdf Backboard QUALITY BRUSHED NICKEL WALL MIRROR: This 30 inch round mirror is crafted with SUS304 stainless steel frame,4mm no-distortion HD floating glass+9mm MDF backboard. Each brushed nickel round mirror are choosing the the premium material to produce, weights up to 21.23lbs with overall 30’’,mirror size 29 3/4’’. The nice brushed nickel frame could fit very well with your faucet. ROUND MIRROR WITH DEEP FRAME DESIGN: With the frame thickness designed from 1’’ to 3’’ deep, this round wall mirror would definitely improve the line designed of your space and it is no found in others. With the good reflection, it would be sure aesthetic part in your space. Let this 30 silver circle mirror improve the gorgeous for your space and be an eye-catcher part in your room. NO DISTORTION AND EASILY HANGING: All of our brushed nickel round vanity mirrors uses 4mm thick silver glass, making sure NO distortion. Four pre-installed reinforced D-Ring coming with all other hardware is included. If any missing in hardware, we would send out the new one for you asap. (Quality Mirror: weighs up to 21.23LBS, two people is recommended during installation) RELIABLE PACKAGING: Every silver round mirror(WALL MOUNTED VETICALLY ONLY) is carefully packed with a PE bag, polyfoam, and master box to ensure perfect condition when you get it. We keep upgrading the packing to decrease any damage for the clients. 10 drop test is done in our factory for the 1st packing. If any damage happens, contact with us freely and we would solve the problem immediately. ANDY STAR VALUE: We stand by our products and your satisfaction. ANDY STAR is always committed to the details and the strict quality inspection from the raw material to any step manufacturing techniques. Each of our mirror would be followed more than 50 steps process and double inspections before arriving to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zl+6opH+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANDY STAR","source_asin":"B09B35CJKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B35CJKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B35CJKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
