window.products.push({"id":327933,"name":"Decorative Carrying Serving Tray with Handles - Set of 2 - Ottoman Tray - Southern Chic Organization Style - Coffee Table Tray (Turquoise + Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NrRmgzisL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SERVING YOUR DISHES HAS NEVER LOOKED THIS PRETTY Impressive Durability in Action Shopping around for a sturdy serving tray strong enough to handle everything from heavy cutlery, weighty fruits, to that full bottle of wine? Then you’ll love the VeraCasa serving tray set. We’ve used MDF- one of the most solid forms of engineered wood products- to create trays you can use to confidently carry your cutlery and food without fear of things falling apart. And unlike other bulky serving trays that are a pain to carry, ours is conveniently lightweight and comes with smoothened, ergonomically-crafted handles. So whether you’re serving that special someone breakfast in bed, or carrying that tea set to the garden, you’ll be able to do so without any strain. Wow Your Guests Cute and colorful, this decorative serving tray set instantly infuses any space with a cheerful energy! You’ll love the eye-catching hues, lovely garden-themed styling, and the classic symmetrical design that amplifies the charming aesthetics. This is a great serving tray set to whip out whenever you have company over and also makes a gift just about anyone will cherish. If you’re hunting around for a unique wedding present or birthday gift for the home maker in your life, then this pretty serving tray set will be a guaranteed hit. Here’s what distinguishes this tray set: - Backed by our no-hassle money-back guarantee. - Solid construction handles the weight of your dishes. - Lightweight and fitted with ergonomic handles. - The colorful design gives your home a stylish touch. - Very easy to clean with a quick wipe. - Made using MDF for environmental sustainability. - Comes in a set of 2 at a great price. Click ‘Add to Cart’ now to upgrade your home with a beautifully-made serving tray set completely risk-free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NrRmgzisL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VeraCasa","source_asin":"B078SNXRJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SNXRJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SNXRJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
