window.products.push({"id":327973,"name":"Smarty Had A Party Kaya Collection 1248 1/2 Inch Stake Poles-12 Pack Bamboo Poles, 4 Feet, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81660ImuikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In virtually any garden, there's a need to support a plant or provide something that it can climb on. Bamboo is a renewable resource that comes in handy both indoors and out. As such, The Kaya Collection ½-Inch Bamboo Poles boast a variety of uses.Strong yet lightweight, natural bamboo is easy to work with and last for several seasons, making it an economical addition that looks great in any garden. To top it off, they're up to three times stronger than wooden stakes of comparable diameter, making them a perfect solution for field staking. Using twine or another sturdy material, you can secure the poles to trees, shrubs, vines, tomatoes and other vegetable plants for support.Using simple tools, bamboo poles can be fashioned into fences, frames, trellises and other structures. Construct a custom-made trellis for climbing plants, allowing them to grab hold of the bamboo as they grow so the plant has support and doesn't topple over. Or secure them to wire cages for extra support, preventing the cage from being knocked over in windy conditions.Beautiful fences and gates can be furnished by fastening separate pieces of bamboo together in lovely patterns, adding a lovely touch to your yard. You can also make a border for a flowerbed or place a pole on its own as a naturally beautiful landscape accent to make a bold statement. The possibilities are nearly limitless.To accommodate everyone’s needs, these aesthetically pleasing, ½-inch bamboo poles are available in a 2-, 4- or 6-foot height and come in your choice of 12- and 24-count packages. With its attractive natural finish and a little imagination, you can come up with a variety of uses for this environmentally-friendly, versatile product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81660ImuikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smarty Had A Party","source_asin":"B07DKZGNKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-327973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DKZGNKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DKZGNKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
